  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Create a Music Web App\r\n\r\nWith the help of AI, complete the missing code in `script.js` to make the Hit or Miss app work.\r\n\r\n**How do I start?**\r\n1. Create a variable for `likes`\r\n2. Complete `likeBtn` event handler \r\n3. Complete `unlikeBtn` event handler\r\n4. Complete `resetBtn` event handler",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "outline",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
